- full component extent versus a particular row/column;
- added color versus copied source color;
- behavior when the test reverses relative object sizes.

Reject interpretations that need arbitrary exceptions. If one example leaves competing hypotheses unresolved and the demo budget permits, ask for another example before committing to a costly wrong submission.

